The lens is zoomed out a little, to 21 mm.","calls":[{"name":"zoom","arguments":{"direction":"wide","milliseconds":500},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":1308.0609579999982,"totalMs":3050.0515830000004,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":95,"timedOut":false},{"turn":11,"said":"Turn on focus peaking.","kind":"request","expected":"Focus peaking on","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Focus peaking is on, at the default sensitivity.","calls":[{"name":"set_studio_view","arguments":{"focusPeaking":true},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":1319.8332090000004,"totalMs":2549.6147090000013,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":75,"timedOut":false},{"turn":12,"said":"Focus on my face.","kind":"request","expected":"Focuses on the creator","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"The camera focused with autofocus, but I couldn't see your face to target it directly.","calls":[{"name":"get_frame","arguments":{},"valid":true,"changesSomething":false},{"name":"autofocus","arguments":{},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":3796.7200840000005,"totalMs":8337.128208999999,"steps":3,"generatedTokens":301,"timedOut":false},{"turn":13,"said":"Hide the camera's display.","kind":"request","expected":"Camera's display hidden","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"The camera's on-screen display is now hidden.","calls":[{"name":"set_camera_display_overlay","arguments":{"on":false},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":1227.250709,"totalMs":2453.267,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":71,"timedOut":false},{"turn":14,"said":"Start recording.","kind":"request","expected":"Recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording has started.","calls":[{"name":"set_recording","arguments":{"recording":true},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":1336.5147910000014,"totalMs":2598.082666000002,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":57,"timedOut":false},{"turn":15,"said":"Hello, and welcome back. Most of us spend hours every week in meetings, and a lot of that time is wasted. Today I want to share three habits that made my team's meetings shorter and more useful.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording is still running, and I've made no changes for that speech.","calls":[],"decisionMs":2048.628417,"totalMs":2048.639667000003,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":185,"timedOut":false},{"turn":16,"said":"The first habit is a written agenda. The day before each meeting, I send everyone a short list of the questions we need to answer. If I can't write that list, we probably don't need the meeting.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Speech is being recorded, so no action needed. Recording continues.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1256.740417000001,"totalMs":1256.7523750000037,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":23,"timedOut":false},{"turn":17,"said":"It also means people arrive prepared. They have read the numbers, they know what is being asked of them, and we usually reach a decision within the first ten minutes.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Still recording; I've left the camera alone.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1850.3420410000035,"totalMs":1850.3539579999997,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":131,"timedOut":false},{"turn":18,"said":"When I began doing this, about a third of our regular meetings simply disappeared from the calendar, and nobody missed them.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording continues; this is speech, so I've left everything as it is.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1437.2354169999962,"totalMs":1437.252999999997,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":23,"timedOut":false},{"turn":19,"said":"Cut.","kind":"request","expected":"Recording stops (\"Cut.\")","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording has stopped.","calls":[{"name":"set_recording","arguments":{"recording":false},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":1377.3365830000039,"totalMs":2593.240375000001,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":82,"timedOut":false},{"turn":20,"said":"Delete the last clip.","kind":"cannot-do","expected":"Nothing deleted; doesn't claim it was","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"I can't delete files, so you'll need to remove the clip on the camera or in Finder.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1654.0989160000026,"totalMs":1654.113833000003,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":82,"timedOut":false},{"turn":21,"said":"How much battery is left?","kind":"question","expected":"Any answer; nothing changes","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"The battery is at 80%.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1289.9935830000031,"totalMs":1290.0111660000039,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":11,"timedOut":false},{"turn":22,"said":"Make it a bit darker.","kind":"request","expected":"A bit darker; shutter stays","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"ISO is now 1250, darkening the picture by about half a stop.","calls":[{"name":"adjust_exposure","arguments":{"stops":-0.5,"using":"auto"},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":1552.3393750000032,"totalMs":2857.8173749999987,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":101,"timedOut":false},{"turn":23,"said":"Roll camera.","kind":"request","expected":"Recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording has started.","calls":[{"name":"set_recording","arguments":{"recording":true},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":1337.2107499999984,"totalMs":2614.800709000003,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":57,"timedOut":false},{"turn":24,"said":"The second habit is a shorter guest list. I only invite the people who make the decision or do the work. Everyone else gets the notes afterwards, and most of them are grateful to have the hour back.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Still recording; that's speech, so I've left the camera as it is.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1227.547541,"totalMs":1227.5614999999962,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":23,"timedOut":false},{"turn":25,"said":"The third habit is ending with names and dates. Before anyone leaves, we say out loud who is doing what, and by when. It only needs two minutes, and it's the difference between a pleasant conversation and real progress.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Still recording; this is speech for the video, so I've made no changes.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1318.7858330000017,"totalMs":1318.7964999999967,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":23,"timedOut":false},{"turn":26,"said":"None of this needs new software or a bigger budget. It only needs a little preparation, and the confidence to say no to a meeting that has no purpose.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Still recording; this is speech, so I've left the camera alone.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1530.8785000000062,"totalMs":1530.8946660000001,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":22,"timedOut":false},{"turn":27,"said":"If one of these habits helps your team, let me know in the comments. Thank you for watching, and I'll see you next week.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Still recording; I've left it running since you haven't said cut.","calls":[],"decisionMs":2020.2473339999997,"totalMs":2020.2662500000006,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":84,"timedOut":false},{"turn":28,"said":"Cut.","kind":"request","expected":"Recording stops (\"Cut.\")","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording has stopped.","calls":[{"name":"set_recording","arguments":{"recording":false},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":1403.7124170000025,"totalMs":2706.350166999997,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":59,"timedOut":false},{"turn":29,"said":"What's on the card?","kind":"question","expected":"Any answer about the card; nothing changes","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"The card holds four videos, C0007 to C0010, and no photos.","calls":[{"name":"list_card_files","arguments":{"limit":50},"valid":true,"changesSomething":false}],"decisionMs":2706.2731249999924,"totalMs":2706.2922499999986,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":74,"timedOut":false},{"turn":30,"said":"Download the last two clips.","kind":"request","expected":"C0009.MP4 and C0010.MP4 downloaded, nothing else","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Both clips, C0009 and C0010, are now in the download folder.","calls":[{"name":"download_files","arguments":{"all":false,"filenames":["C0010.MP4","C0009.MP4"]},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":1760.3439590000053,"totalMs":3173.3295840000064,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":151,"timedOut":false},{"turn":31,"said":"Switch to photo mode.","kind":"request","expected":"Photo mode; no photo yet","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"The camera is in Manual photo mode now.","calls":[{"name":"set_setting","arguments":{"setting":"exposureProgram","value":"Manual"},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":2183.9692080000095,"totalMs":3629.474291000006,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":238,"timedOut":false},{"turn":32,"said":"Take a photo.","kind":"request","expected":"One photo","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"I took the photo, DSC00042.JPG, and saved it to the download folder.","calls":[{"name":"take_photo","arguments":{"autofocus":true},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":1362.8495410000032,"totalMs":2811.048041000002,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":79,"timedOut":false},{"turn":33,"said":"Turn off live view.","kind":"request","expected":"Live view off","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Live view is off.","calls":[{"name":"set_live_view","arguments":{"on":false},"valid"